--- !u!114 &205622256
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 205622255}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e25280f40d530e459e9d17ead96794e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoadingScreen
  canvasGameObject: {fileID: 516020019}
  loadingText: {fileID: 993785995}
  baseText: Loading
  dotInterval: 0.4
  maxDots: 3
  hintText: {fileID: 2141856953}
  hints:
  - Press <color=#FFA000>Space</color> to <color=#00FFFF>Dash</color>.\nYou are <color=#FFA000>Invincible</color>
    while <color=#00FFFF>Dashing</color>.\nWith good timing you can even pass right
    through enemy attacks, triggering a <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge</color>!
  - Your <color=#FF00FF>Shield</color> is a percent of your <color=#00FF00>Max Health</color>.\nRaise
    your <color=#00FF00>Health</color> to increase your <color=#FFA000>Shield</color>!
  - Hold <color=#FFA000>Right Click</color> to <color=#FFFF00>Surge</color> to dispatch
    threats quickly!\n<color=#FFFF00>Surging</color> doubles your <color=#FF0050>Attack
    Speed</color> but halves your <color=#FFFFFF>Move Speed</color>.
  - Bosses <color=#FFA000>Enrage</color> after 2 minutes, becoming stronger as time
    passes.\nFinish them off quickly!
  - <color=#00FF87>Luck</color> clamps your damage ranges towards the maximum with
    a chance to <color=#00FF87>Highroll</color> for 300% damage! Happy Highrolling!
  - Only <color=#FFA000>Spiky</color> enemies and objects deal contact damage.\nFeel
    free to hug everyone else!\n...and the <color=#FFA000>Spiky</color> ones too
    if you want.
  - Some <color=#FFA000>Augments</color> and <color=#FFB4FF>Abilities</color> can
    <color=#FFA000>Interrupt</color> enemy attacks, <color=#FFFF00>Stunning</color>
    them.
  - Stand near fallen allies to <color=#FFA000>Revive</color> them.\n<color=#FFA000>Reviving</color>
    takes longer each time you fall, so be careful!
  - You can <color=#FFFF00>Surge</color> during most <color=#FFB4FF>Abilities</color>.
  - Some <color=#FFA000>Augments</color> work exceptionally well with certain other
    <color=#FFA000>Augments</color>, <color=#FFA000>Characters</color> and <color=#FFA000>Stats</color>.\nTry
    to find the best combinations!
  - Try to save one of your <color=#00FFFF>Dash Charges</color> for a sticky situation.\nYou
    don't want to run out when enemies are nearby.
  - <color=#FFFFFF>Death Prevention</color> can save you from lethal attacks!\nIt
    has a 30 second cooldown, so watch your <color=#FFA000>HUD</color> to see if
    it's up!
  - All damage is rolled by <color=#00FF87>Luck</color> and can <color=#00FF87>Highroll</color>.
  - <color=#00FF87>Highrolling</color> is rolling within the top 5% of base <color=#00FF87>Luck
    Variance</color>.
  - Make sure you remember to spend the <color=#FFA000>Points</color> you earn at
    the <color=#FFA000>Upgrade Shop</color>!
  - You can hold <color=#FFA000>Tab</color> to see additional stats and all the <color=#FFA000>Augments</color>
    you've picked up!
  - You can hover <color=#FFA000>Augments</color> on the <color=#FFA000>Tab</color>
    screen with your <color=#FFA000>Cursor</color> to see their descriptions with
    live values.
  - You can hover your <color=#FFA000>Abilities</color> with your <color=#FFA000>Cursor</color>
    to see their descriptions with live values.
  - <color=#FFA000>Interrupting</color> an enemy attack <color=#FFFF00>Stuns</color>
    it!
  - Enemies lose track of <color=#FFA000>Invisible</color> targets.\nUse it to reposition,
    attack or revive your allies while unnoticed!
  - <color=#FFA000>Taunts</color> attract the attention of ALL enemies.\nUse it to
    save your teammates from a sticky situation!
  - All <color=#FFA000>Experience</color> and <color=#FFA000>Points</color> are shared
    between allies!
  - Harder enemies reward more <color=#FFA000>Points</color>!\nThe longer you survive,
    the more <color=#FFA000>Points</color> you'll earn!
  - Your <color=#FF00FF>Shield</color> takes some time to <color=#FF00FF>Recharge</color>.\nTry
    to avoid combat while it's <color=#FF00FF>Recharging</color>!
  - Unlock <color=#FFA000>Threat Levels</color> by completing the previous <color=#FFA000>Threat
    Level</color>.\nThey may also unlock other things...
  - <color=#FF8700>Crit Chance</color> gives all damage you deal a chance to <color=#FF8700>Critically
    Strike</color> for 300% damage!
  - <color=#FFA000>Weapon</color> and <color=#FFA000>Multishot Counts</color> increase
    <color=#FFA000>Total DPS</color>, even if each <color=#FFA000>Weapon Strike</color>
    from them deals slightly less damage.
  - <color=#FFFF00>Berserk Surge</color> is an <color=#FFA000>uncancellable</color>
    <color=#FFFF00>Surge</color> that grants <color=#FFFF00>Full Energy</color> right
    away and <color=#FFA000>Invincibility</color> during it. But <color=#FF00FF>Shield</color>
    and <color=#FFFFFF>Death Prevention</color> timers are paused during it as well.
  hintInterval: 10
